"pl-c1\">-</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"required\"</span>: {<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusBadRequest</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Message</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Required input body| current_password, new_password, confirm_password\"</span>},\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"required\"</span>: {<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusBadRequest</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Message</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">reqMsg</span>},\n \t\t}); <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> {\n \t\t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">status</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">msg</span>})\n \t\t}\n \t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusBadRequest</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Invalid request body\"</span>})\n \t}\n \n \t<span class=\"pl-c\">// check password confirm</span>\n \t<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">NewPassword</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">ConfirmPassword</span> {\n \t\t<span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusConflict</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Password not same\"</span>})\n \t}\n \n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">GetAuthUser</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">nil</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">// helpers.GetAuthUser already sends Error response</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t}\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// Verify current password</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">md5</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Sum</span>([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">byte</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">CurrentPassword</span>))\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">EncodeToString</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span>[:])\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> user.<span class=\"pl-smi\">Password</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusConflict</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Current password not match\"</span>})\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-c\">// Verify current password only if user already has an existing password</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">hasPassword</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">md5</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Sum</span>([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">byte</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">CurrentPassword</span>))\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">EncodeToString</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span>[:])\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> user.<span class=\"pl-smi\">Password</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusConflict</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Current password not match\"</span>})\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t}\n \t}\n \n \t<span class=\"pl-c\">// Hash new password</span>\n \t<span class=\"pl-s1\">newSum</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">md5</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Sum</span>([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">byte</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">NewPassword</span>))\n \t<span class=\"pl-s1\">newHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">EncodeToString</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">newSum</span>[:])\n \n \t<span class=\"pl-c\">// Update user</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">DB</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Model</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">Updates</span>(<span class=\"pl-k\">map</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>]<span class=\"pl-k\">interface</span>{}{\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"password\"</span>:   <span class=\"pl-s1\">newHashed</span>,\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"updated_at\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">time</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Now</span>(),\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t}).<span class=\"pl-c1\">Error</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">DB</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">nil</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">config</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">DB</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Model</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">Updates</span>(<span class=\"pl-k\">map</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>]<span class=\"pl-k\">interface</span>{}{\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"password\"</span>:   <span class=\"pl-s1\">newHashed</span>,\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s\">\"updated_at\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">time</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Now</span>(),\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t}).<span class=\"pl-c1\">Error</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">nil</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusConflict</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Update Password failed\"</span>})\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t}\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t}\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Password</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">newHashed</span></pre></div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">2. <code class=\"notranslate\">src/helpers/user.go</code></h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"func GetAuthUser(c *fiber.Ctx) (*models.User, error) {\n+\tif u, ok := c.Locals(&quot;auth_user&quot;).(*models.User); ok &amp;&amp; u != nil {\n+\t\treturn u, nil\n+\t}\n+\n+\tsubVal := c.Locals(&quot;sub&quot;)\n+\tencrypt, ok := subVal.(string)\n+\tif !ok || encrypt == &quot;&quot; {\n+\t\treturn nil, SendError(c, ErrorOpts{Status: fiber.StatusUnauthorized, Messages: &quot;Unauthorized&quot;})\n+\t}\n-\tencrypt := c.Locals(&quot;sub&quot;).(string)\n\n \tvar user models.User\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">func</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">GetAuthUser</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span>fiber.<span class=\"pl-smi\">Ctx</span>) (<span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span>models.<span class=\"pl-smi\">User</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">error</span>) {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">u</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Locals</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"auth_user\"</span>).(<span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span>models.<span class=\"pl-smi\">User</span>); <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">u</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">nil</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">u</span>, <span class=\"pl-c1\">nil</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t}\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">subVal</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Locals</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"sub\"</span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">encrypt</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">subVal</span>.(<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">ok</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">||</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">encrypt</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">\"\"</span> {\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">nil</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusUnauthorized</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Unauthorized\"</span>})\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span>\t}\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span>\t<span class=\"pl-s1\">encrypt</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Locals</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"sub\"</span>).(<span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span>)\n\n \t<span class=\"pl-k\">var</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span> models.<span class=\"pl-smi\">User</span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification &amp; Tests</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Test Cases in <code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/auth/updatePassword_test.go</code></h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">google user with current_password null succeeds</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">google user with current_password empty string succeeds</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">google user with current_password omitted succeeds</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">google user with password mismatch returns 409</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">409 Conflict</code> (\"Password not same\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">google user with missing new_password returns 400</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code> (\"Required input body| new_password, confirm_password\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">user with password and current_password null returns 400</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code> (\"Required input body| current_password, new_password, confirm_password\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">user with password and current_password empty string returns 400</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">user with password and current_password omitted returns 400</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">user with wrong current_password returns 409</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">409 Conflict</code> (\"Current password not match\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">user with correct current_password succeeds</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code> (\"Update Password Success\")</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">unauthenticated request returns 401</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">401 Unauthorized</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">invalid JSON body returns 400</code> -&gt; <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Test Command &amp; Results</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-powershell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"go test -v ./src/action/v1/auth -run TestUpdatePassword\ngo test ./...\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">go test <span class=\"pl-k\">-</span>v .<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>src<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>action<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>v1<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>auth <span class=\"pl-k\">-</span>run TestUpdatePassword\ngo test .<span class=\"pl-k\">/</span>...</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All 12 test cases in <code class=\"notranslate\">TestUpdatePassword</code> and all other test suites in the repository passed with 0 failures.<br>\nStatement coverage on <code class=\"notranslate\">updatePassword.go</code> is <strong>87.1%</strong>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Overview</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Endpoint <code class=\"notranslate\">POST /v1/auth/password</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">controllers.UpdatePassword</code>) allows authenticated users to set or change their account password. Users who register via Google OAuth (or other third-party OAuth providers) do not have an initial password stored in the database (<code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password == \"\"</code>). When such users attempt to set a password for the first time by passing <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password: null</code> (or an empty/omitted current password), the API previously returned <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code>.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Problem &amp; Root Cause Analysis</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Strict Required Validation Tag</strong>:<br>\nThe request struct <code class=\"notranslate\">UpdatePasswordRequest</code> defined <code class=\"notranslate\">CurrentPassword</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">validate:\"required\"</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"type UpdatePasswordRequest struct {\n    CurrentPassword string `json:&quot;current_password&quot; validate:&quot;required&quot;`\n    NewPassword     string `json:&quot;new_password&quot;     validate:&quot;required&quot;`\n    ConfirmPassword string `json:&quot;confirm_password&quot; validate:&quot;required&quot;`\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">UpdatePasswordRequest</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">CurrentPassword</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"current_password\" validate:\"required\"`</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">NewPassword</span>     <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"new_password\"     validate:\"required\"`</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">ConfirmPassword</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`json:\"confirm_password\" validate:\"required\"`</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">When a user sends payload:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n    &quot;current_password&quot;: null,\n    &quot;new_password&quot;: &quot;1234567trCD&quot;,\n    &quot;confirm_password&quot;: &quot;1234567trCD&quot;\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"current_password\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">null</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"new_password\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>1234567trCD<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"confirm_password\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>1234567trCD<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The validator flagged <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> as missing/empty and immediately rejected the request with <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n    &quot;data&quot;: {\n        &quot;errors&quot;: {\n            &quot;input&quot;: &quot; current_password, new_password, confirm_password&quot;,\n            &quot;messages&quot;: &quot;Required input body&quot;\n        },\n        &quot;status&quot;: &quot;BAD_REQUEST&quot;,\n        &quot;valid&quot;: false\n    },\n    &quot;statusCode&quot;: 400\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"errors\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"input\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span> current_password, new_password, confirm_password<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n            <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Required input body<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n        },\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>BAD_REQUEST<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n    },\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">400</span>\n}</pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Unconditional Current Password Verification</strong>:<br>\nEven if validation was bypassed, the handler unconditionally performed an MD5 hash check against <code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"currSum := md5.Sum([]byte(req.CurrentPassword))\ncurrHashed := hex.EncodeToString(currSum[:])\nif currHashed != user.Password {\n    return helpers.SendError(c, helpers.ErrorOpts{Status: fiber.StatusConflict, Messages: &quot;Current password not match&quot;})\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">md5</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Sum</span>([]<span class=\"pl-smi\">byte</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">req</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">CurrentPassword</span>))\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">:=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">hex</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">EncodeToString</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">currSum</span>[:])\n<span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">currHashed</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">!=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">user</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Password</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">helpers</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">SendError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">c</span>, helpers.<span class=\"pl-smi\">ErrorOpts</span>{<span class=\"pl-s1\">Status</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">fiber</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">StatusConflict</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">Messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\">\"Current password not match\"</span>})\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For OAuth users where <code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password == \"\"</code>, comparing MD5(\"\") (<code class=\"notranslate\">d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e</code>) against <code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"</code> would always evaluate to not equal and fail with <code class=\"notranslate\">409 Conflict</code> (\"Current password not match\").</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Goals</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Allow users without an existing password (<code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password == \"\"</code>) to set their account password with <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> being <code class=\"notranslate\">null</code>, empty string <code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"</code>, or omitted.</li>\n<li>Maintain strict <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> requirements and MD5 hash verification for users who already have an established password (<code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password != \"\"</code>).</li>\n<li>Ensure input validation messages appropriately reflect whether <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> is expected.</li>\n<li>Support safe user retrieval and mockable user context for testing without requiring live database connections.</li>\n<li>Provide comprehensive unit tests covering OAuth user scenarios, standard user scenarios, validation errors, and authentication failures.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Scope</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In scope:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/auth/updatePassword.go</code>: Make <code class=\"notranslate\">CurrentPassword</code> optional when <code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password == \"\"</code>, validate dynamically based on password status, and skip old password verification for passwordless accounts.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/helpers/user.go</code>: Support <code class=\"notranslate\">c.Locals(\"auth_user\")</code> mock injection and nil-safe extraction of <code class=\"notranslate\">c.Locals(\"sub\")</code>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/action/v1/auth/updatePassword_test.go</code>: Unit tests for all password update workflows.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Out of scope:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Changes to user registration flows (<code class=\"notranslate\">registerUser.go</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">authGoogle.go</code>).</li>\n<li>Changes to OTP-based password reset (<code class=\"notranslate\">resetPassword.go</code>).</li>\n<li>Database schema changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>When <code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password == \"\"</code>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Sending <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password: null</code> with valid matching new passwords updates the password in DB and returns <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code> (\"Update Password Success\").</li>\n<li>Sending <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password: \"\"</code> or omitting <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code>.</li>\n<li>Sending mismatched <code class=\"notranslate\">new_password</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">confirm_password</code> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">409 Conflict</code> (\"Password not same\").</li>\n<li>Missing <code class=\"notranslate\">new_password</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">confirm_password</code> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code> (\"Required input body| new_password, confirm_password\").</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>When <code class=\"notranslate\">user.Password != \"\"</code>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Sending <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password: null</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">\"\"</code>, or omitting it returns <code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code> (\"Required input body| current_password, new_password, confirm_password\").</li>\n<li>Sending an incorrect <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">409 Conflict</code> (\"Current password not match\").</li>\n<li>Sending matching valid <code class=\"notranslate\">current_password</code> and new passwords updates the password in DB and returns <code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Unauthenticated requests return <code class=\"notranslate\">401 Unauthorized</code>.</li>\n<li>All unit and project test suites pass (<code class=\"notranslate\">go test ./...</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Implementation Reference</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For detailed code changes and resolution strategy, refer to:<br>\n<a href=\"./implementations/fix_update_password_google_user.md\">Implementation Document</a></p>",
